{"prefectureId":"36","cities":{"36201":[{"id":"36201:national:879fc549fdd0","cityId":"36201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「阿波国分寺庭園」は国指定の名勝です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/3232"},{"id":"36201:national:3d6407312aba","cityId":"36201","category":"文化・名所","text":"徳島市の観光客入り込み客数は、年間229万5,000人です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BE%B3%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=110949442"},{"id":"36201:national:4235f5f1d8bf","cityId":"36201","category":"地域","text":"徳島市は、徳島県の東部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BE%B3%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=110949442"}],"36202":[{"id":"36202:national:47f547c0f543","cityId":"36202","category":"地理・自然","text":"鳴門市には大麻山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B3%B4%E9%96%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111228899"},{"id":"36202:national:0b529b5374f4","cityId":"36202","category":"地理・自然","text":"鳴門市には天円山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B3%B4%E9%96%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111228899"},{"id":"36202:national:cc2cf1d3cef6","cityId":"36202","category":"地域","text":"鳴門市は、四国の東端、徳島県の北東端に位置し、鳴門海峡の西側に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B3%B4%E9%96%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111228899"}],"36203":[{"id":"36203:national:3db0d328bb45","cityId":"36203","category":"地理・自然","text":"小松島市には日峰山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B0%8F%E6%9D%BE%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=110785776"},{"id":"36203:national:de8f5ac970d5","cityId":"36203","category":"地理・自然","text":"小松島市には中津峰山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B0%8F%E6%9D%BE%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=110785776"},{"id":"36203:national:768a5dd16006","cityId":"36203","category":"地域","text":"小松島市は、徳島県のおよそ東部中央、紀伊水道沿岸に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B0%8F%E6%9D%BE%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=110785776"},{"id":"36203:national:f3626ac6fccc","cityId":"36203","category":"地域","text":"市の中心地は徳島小松島港付近であり、市役所や図書館などが位置する。","source":"ht